This patch is part of SaveHITL-pub. The SaveHITL project changed the
following OpenL2D file in 2026:
  Code/synthetic_experts/expert_gen.py
Why: it fixes a defect in OpenL2D. With the benchmark's own expert
settings, one line builds the protected-attribute weights as a list of
empty values, and a later line indexes into each of those empty values,
so the expert generator stops with a type error before fitting any
expert. This patch changes that one line.
